      "ESSeqNum": 2,
      "FacilityID": 1000122983,
      "SummaryText": "n the cause and nature of a release facility wide changes to the handling, storage and equipment or review operational procedures including operators training and implementation can be involved or may be changed to address the event and reduce the potential for re-occurrence."
